\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/food-drink/phoenix-bar-pizzeria/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Phoenix Bar &#038; Pizzeria</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-65751\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-65751 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"The Terrace\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/the-terrace/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">The Terrace</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-65499\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-65499 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"East Court Café\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/food-drink/east-court-cafe/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">East Court Café</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38040\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38040 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Boathouse Café\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/food-drink/boathouse-cafe/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Boathouse Café</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38042\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38042 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Grove Café\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/food-drink/grove-cafe/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Grove Café</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38048\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children dropdown menu-item-38048 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Discover\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"dropdown-toggle nav-link\" id=\"menu-item-dropdow