n-item\">Stories</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38059\" class=\"mobile_sub_title menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38059 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Projects\" href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Projects</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-136179\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-136179 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Strategic Plan\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/strategic-plan/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Strategic Plan</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-45367\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-45367 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"East Wing Restoration\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/restoration/overview/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">East Wing Restoration</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-116441\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-116441 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Sustainability\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/the-park/sustainability/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Sustainability</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38068\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38068 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Support Us\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/support-us/\" class=\"nav-link\">Support Us</a></li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38069\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38069 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Venue Hire\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/venue-hire/spaces/\" class=\"nav-link\">Venue Hire</a></li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38070\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38070 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Contact\" href=\"/contact/get-in-touch\" class=\"nav-link\">Contact</a></li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38071\" class=\"d-block d-lg-none mobile_mailing menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38071 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Join our mailing list\" href=\"/contact/get-in-touch/#footer-newsletter-form\" class=\"nav-link\">Join our mailing list</a></li>\n</ul></div>        </div>\n      </nav>\n      <!-- End Mobile Nav -->\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"search\" id=\"search_container\">\n    <div class=\"search_content\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n          <h1 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search</h1>\n          <h2 class=\"h1\">What are you looking for?</h2>\n        </header>\n\n        <button id=\"btn-search-close\" class=\"btn btn--search-close\" aria-label=\"Close search form\">Close <span></span></button>\n        <label class=\"screen-reader-text\" for=\"search-input\">Search:</label>\n        <form class=\"search__form\" action=\"/search\" method=\"get\" role=\"search\">\n          <input type=\"text\" class=\"search__input\" id=\"search-input\" name=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Start typing...\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" value=\"\" />\n          <button class=\"btn btn--search\"><i class=\"sprite sprite_search_white\"></i><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search</span></button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"search__suggested\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">You might be looking for…</h3>\n          <ul class=\"search_tags\">\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/opening-times/\">OPENING HOURS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\">PARKING</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#sport\">SPORT</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#live-events\">LIVE EVENTS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/about-us/blog/\">BLOG</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"search__related\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">Top results</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 search_suggestions\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-ap btn-pink btn_results pull-right\">All results <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <main class=\"content\" id=\"primary\">\n    <div class=\"header_media proportional_container container--header_media\">\n    <img width=\"1920\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1920x700-1.png\" class=\"header_image_desktop\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1920x700-1.png 1920w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1920x700-1-650x237.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1920x700-1-1620x591.png 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1920x700-1-768x280.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1920x700-1-1536x560.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />    <img width=\"560\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1080x1080-1-560x700.png\" class=\"header_image_mobile\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></div><div class=\"margins\">\n        <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <ol>\n            <li class=\"crumb\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\">Home</a>\n            </li>\n                        <li class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/\">What&#8217;s On</a></li>            <li class=\"crumb--current\">\n                <span aria-current=\"page\">London Squash Classic</span>\n            </li>\n        </ol>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"event_content\" class=\"margins grid grid--3_1 component\">\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n        <h1>London Squash Classic</h1>\n            </div>      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n        <div class=\"event_details\"><p class=\"text-uppercase\">2 - 6 Sep 2026</p><p>Alexandra Palace Theatre</p></div>    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">      \n        <div class=\"ap_text_block\">\n    <p>The London Squash Classic is back at <strong>Alexandra Palace Theatre</strong> following its spectacular debut last year, with the 2026 edition set to take place between 2 – 6 September, once again featuring both a men’s and women’s draw.</p>\n<p>The Gold-level event became an instant favourite amongst squash fans new and old last year, with the gladiatorial battles thrilling capacity crowds in the bear-pit atmosphere of the amphitheatre. For the past 2 years we saw the world’s best squash players descend on Alexandra Palace, with Egypt&#8217;s <strong>Amina Orfi</strong> capturing the women’s title, while New Zealand’s <strong>former World No.1 Paul Coll</strong> put in a series of spectacular performances to secure the men’s title.</p>\n<p>The world’s best will be back again this September, join us for an amazing spectacle of squash!</p>\n</div><div class=\"ap_accordion_block ap_block\" id=\"\">\n    <h3></h3>\n            <details class=\"ap_accordion\" id=\"day-tickets\">\n                <summary>Day Tickets </summary>\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <p>Day tickets are available on following days, which will admit you into both the 1pm &amp; 6pm sessions:<br />\nRound 2 – Day 1<br />\nRound 2 – Day 2<br />\nQuarter Finals – Day 3</p>\n<p>To purchase please select session 1 and add ticket to basket. In the basket, you will be prompted with a link to session 2. Select your seat for this session and add to basket. This will automatically add the discount to your basket.</p>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n                        <details class=\"ap_accordion\" id=\"classic-lounge-and-t-bar-tickets\">\n                <summary>Classic Lounge and T-Bar Tickets</summary>\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <p>Valid Wednesday–Thursday. Grants access to the Classic Lounge (or T-Bar), which features a private bar. (Please note that drinks are not included in the ticket price).</p>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n                        <details class=\"ap_accordion\" id=\"vip-tickets\">\n                <summary>VIP Tickets </summary>\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <p>Includes access to the Classic Lounge with a private bar, plus entry to the Mizuki Bar. VIP tickets also cover food and beverages (beer, wine, and soft drinks). Food will be served at scheduled times, which will be shared with ticket holders closer to the event.</p>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n                        <details class=\"ap_accordion\" id=\"group-tickets\">\n                <summary>Group Tickets </summary>\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <p>For group bookings please contact <a href=\"mailto:ticketing@psasquashtour.com\">ticketing@psasquashtour.com</a></p>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n                        <details class=\"ap_accordion\" id=\"entry-times\">\n                <summary>Entry times</summary>\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><b><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">For Wednesday, Thursday and Friday Afternoon Sessions</span></b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Venue doors open at 12pm and auditorium doors open at 12:30pm.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><b>For Evening Sessions</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Venue doors open at 5pm and auditorium doors open at 5:30pm.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><b>For Saturday and Sunday</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Venue doors open at 2pm and auditorium doors open at 2:30pm.</span></p>\n</div>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            </div>            </div>                      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n                   <ul class=\"event_buttons\">\n            <li class=\"tickets_btn\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn-pink btn_arrow btn-block \" href=\"#tickets\">Buy Tickets</a>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n        <ul class=\"event_buttons\">\n                                            <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\" >How to get here</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/visitor-information/car-parking/\" >Car Parking</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/faqs#theatre\" >FAQs</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/asafeandsecureexperience/\" >Safe and secure</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/visitor-information/accessibility/\" >Accessibility</a>\n                </li>\n                                            </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"event_secondary_content\">    \n                <div class=\"events_calendar ap_whats_on_block bg_light_pink\">\n    \n            <div class=\"padding\">\n            <div id=\"events-container\" class=\"events_grid\">\n\n                <div id=\"base-layer\" class=\"layer active\">\n                                            <div class=\"month-container\" id=\"scroll_20269\" data-year=\"2026\" data-month=\"9\"  data-name=\"September\">\n                            <aside class=\"display_month_sidebar\"><h2 class=\"display-month\">September</h2></aside>\n                            <div class=\"display_year_sidebar display-year\"><h2>2026</h2></div>\n                                                                                    <div class=\"grid grid--33\">\n                                                                                                        <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  whats-on-item calendar-item event_item current-event\" data-london-classic=\"181\" data-spektrix=\"154\" data-sport=\"16\" data-theatre=\"14\" data-taxonomy=\"181,154,16,14\">\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Wednesday-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-650x650.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Wednesday-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-650x650.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Wednesday-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-768x768.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Wednesday-Afternoon-1080x1080-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />                     </div>\n        <header class=\"event_details bg_white inner_padding\">\n            <p class=\"dates uc\"><strong>2 Sep 2026</strong></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/london-classic-2026-round-2-day-1-session-1/\" class=\"event_target\"><h3>London Classic 2026 Round 2: Day 1 &#8211; Session 1</h3>\n                            </a>\n        </header>\n        <footer class=\"event_item_footer bg_pale_blue\">\n            <div class=\"footer_content\">\n                <span target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn event_btn\">Info & Tickets <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n                    </footer>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  whats-on-item calendar-item event_item current-event\" data-london-classic=\"181\" data-spektrix=\"154\" data-sport=\"16\" data-theatre=\"14\" data-taxonomy=\"181,154,16,14\">\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Wednesday-Evening-1080x1080-1-650x650.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Wednesday-Evening-1080x1080-1-650x650.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Wednesday-Evening-1080x1080-1-768x768.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Wednesday-Evening-1080x1080-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />                     </div>\n        <header class=\"event_details bg_white inner_padding\">\n            <p class=\"dates uc\"><strong>2 Sep 2026</strong></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/london-classic-2026-round-2-day-1-session-2/\" class=\"event_target\"><h3>London Classic 2026 Round 2: Day 1 &#8211; Session 2</h3>\n                            </a>\n        </header>\n        <footer class=\"event_item_footer bg_pale_blue\">\n            <div class=\"footer_content\">\n                <span target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn event_btn\">Info & Tickets <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n                    </footer>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  whats-on-item calendar-item event_item current-event\" data-london-classic=\"181\" data-spektrix=\"154\" data-sport=\"16\" data-theatre=\"14\" data-taxonomy=\"181,154,16,14\">\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Thursday-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-650x650.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Thursday-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-650x650.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Thursday-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-768x768.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Thursday-Afternoon-1080x1080-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />                     </div>\n        <header class=\"event_details bg_white inner_padding\">\n            <p class=\"dates uc\"><strong>3 Sep 2026</strong></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/london-classic-2026-round-2-day-2-session-1/\" class=\"event_target\"><h3>London Classic 2026 Round 2: Day 2 &#8211; Session 1</h3>\n                            </a>\n        </header>\n        <footer class=\"event_item_footer bg_pale_blue\">\n            <div class=\"footer_content\">\n                <span target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn event_btn\">Info & Tickets <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n                    </footer>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  whats-on-item calendar-item event_item current-event\" data-london-classic=\"181\" data-spektrix=\"154\" data-sport=\"16\" data-theatre=\"14\" data-taxonomy=\"181,154,16,14\">\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Thursday-Evening-1080x1080-1-650x650.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Thursday-Evening-1080x1080-1-650x650.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Thursday-Evening-1080x1080-1-768x768.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/R2-Thursday-Evening-1080x1080-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />                     </div>\n        <header class=\"event_details bg_white inner_padding\">\n            <p class=\"dates uc\"><strong>3 Sep 2026</strong></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/london-classic-2026-round-2-day-2-session-2/\" class=\"event_target\"><h3>London Classic 2026 Round 2: Day 2 &#8211; Session 2</h3>\n                            </a>\n        </header>\n        <footer class=\"event_item_footer bg_pale_blue\">\n            <div class=\"footer_content\">\n                <span target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn event_btn\">Info & Tickets <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n                    </footer>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  whats-on-item calendar-item event_item current-event\" data-london-classic=\"181\" data-spektrix=\"154\" data-sport=\"16\" data-theatre=\"14\" data-taxonomy=\"181,154,16,14\">\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-650x650.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-650x650.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Afternoon-1080x1080-1-768x768.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Afternoon-1080x1080-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />                     </div>\n        <header class=\"event_details bg_white inner_padding\">\n            <p class=\"dates uc\"><strong>4 Sep 2026</strong></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/london-classic-2026-quarter-finals-day-3-session-1/\" class=\"event_target\"><h3>London Classic 2026 Quarter Finals: Day 3 &#8211; Session 1</h3>\n                            </a>\n        </header>\n        <footer class=\"event_item_footer bg_pale_blue\">\n            <div class=\"footer_content\">\n                <span target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn event_btn\">Info & Tickets <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n                    </footer>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  whats-on-item calendar-item event_item current-event\" data-london-classic=\"181\" data-spektrix=\"154\" data-sport=\"16\" data-theatre=\"14\" data-taxonomy=\"181,154,16,14\">\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1080x1080-2-650x650.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1080x1080-2-650x650.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1080x1080-2-768x768.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QFs-Evening-1080x1080-2.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />                     </div>\n        <header class=\"event_details bg_white inner_padding\">\n            <p class=\"dates uc\"><strong>4 Sep 2026</strong></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/london-classic-2026-quarter-finals-day-3-session-2/\" class=\"event_target\"><h3>London Classic 2026 Quarter Finals: Day 3 &#8211; Session 2</h3>\n                            </a>\n        </header>\n        <footer class=\"event_item_footer bg_pale_blue\">\n            <div class=\"footer_content\">\n                <span target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn event_btn\">Info & Tickets <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n                    </footer>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  whats-on-item calendar-item event_item current-event\" data-london-classic=\"181\" data-spektrix=\"154\" data-sport=\"16\" data-theatre=\"14\" data-taxonomy=\"181,154,16,14\">\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Semis-1080x1080-1-650x650.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Semis-1080x1080-1-650x650.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Semis-1080x1080-1-768x768.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Semis-1080x1080-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />                     </div>\n        <header class=\"event_details bg_white inner_padding\">\n            <p class=\"dates uc\"><strong>5 Sep 2026</strong></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/london-classic-2026-semi-finals/\" class=\"event_target\"><h3>London Classic 2026 Semi-Finals</h3>\n                            </a>\n        </header>\n        <footer class=\"event_item_footer bg_pale_blue\">\n            <div class=\"footer_content\">\n                <span target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn event_btn\">Info & Tickets <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n                    </footer>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  whats-on-item calendar-item event_item current-event\" data-london-classic=\"181\" data-spektrix=\"154\" data-sport=\"16\" data-theatre=\"14\" data-taxonomy=\"181,154,16,14\">\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Finals-1080x1080-1-650x650.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Finals-1080x1080-1-650x650.png 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Finals-1080x1080-1-768x768.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Finals-1080x1080-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />                     </div>\n        <header class=\"event_details bg_white inner_padding\">\n            <p class=\"dates uc\"><strong>6 Sep 2026</strong></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/london-classic-2026-finals/\" class=\"event_target\"><h3>London Classic 2026 Finals</h3>\n                            </a>\n        </header>\n        <footer class=\"event_item_footer bg_pale_blue\">\n            <div class=\"footer_content\">\n                <span target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn event_btn\">Info & Tickets <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n                    </footer>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                                                                                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n            \n                                  \n        </div>\n        \n</div>  <div class=\"container-fluid section-footer-newsletter-form\" id=\"footer-newsletter-form\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n              <h2 style=\"text-align: left\" class=\"vc_custom_heading\">Sign up to our newsletter</h2>\n              <p>\n                Join our mailing list for Ally Pally updates, news and exclusive access to pre-sale tickets\n              </p>\n                      <form data-action=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-json/spektrix/v1/form_tags\" class=\"form-inline\" id=\"ap_form_tags\" data-redirect=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/thank-you-for-signing-up/\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Tags\" name=\"Tags\" value=\"17601ADSBKGQMMPTLRCMTNQVQJNSBPVNG\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"form_tags_nonce\" name=\"form_tags_nonce\" value=\"6300675430\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wp_http_referer\" value=\"/whats-on/london-squash-classic/\" />            <div class=\"form-group name-group\">\n                <label for=\"FirstName\">Name</label>\n                <input name=\"FirstName\" id=\"FirstName\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter your first name\" required/>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group name-group lastname-group\">\n                <label for=\"LastName\">Surname</label>\n                <input name=\"LastName\" id=\"LastName\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter your surname\" required/>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group email-group\">\n                <label for=\"Email\">Email Address</label>\n                <input name=\"Email\" id=\"Email\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address\" required/>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group control-group\">\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"ap_btn_fill_icon ap_btn_pink btn_subscribe\">Sign up</button>\n            </div>\n        </form>\n                    <div class=\"form-additional-text\"><p>Local to Ally Pally? <a href=\"https://alexandrapalace.com/community-sign-up/\">Sign up to our Community Newsletter</a></p></div>\n                <p class=\"signup_notice\">By signing up you are agreeing to our <a href=\"/privacy-policy/\">Privacy&nbsp;Policy</a></p>\n        <div id=\"ap_form_tags_response\"></div>\n                </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"container-fluid site_footer\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n\n          <div class=\"col-md-3 order-md-1 footer_column\">\n            <h3 class=\"h5 text-uppercase\">social media</h5>\n              <ul class=\"list-inline social_icons\">\n                <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/YourAllyPally\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Ally Pally Facebook\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Ally Pally Facebook</span><i class=\"sprite sprite_fb\"></i></a>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCokPPHKEjs_E6ipz549nueQ\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Ally Pally Youtube\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Ally Pally Youtube</span><i class=\"sprite sprite_yt\"></i></a>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Yourallypally\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Ally Pally X\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Ally Pally X</span><img src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/X-Twitter-Logo-01.png\" alt=\"x\" width=\"20\"></a>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/YourAllyPally/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Ally Pally Instagram\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Ally Pally Instagram</span><i class=\"sprite sprite_i\"></i></a>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com