"East Court\" href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-item\">East Court</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38033\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38033 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Find out more\" href=\"/east-court\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Find out more</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38034\" class=\"mobile_sub_title menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38034 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"The Park\" href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-item\">The Park</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38035\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38035 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Explore\" href=\"/the-park\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Explore</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-117754\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-117754 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Summer Season\" href=\"/summer-season/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Summer Season</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38036\" class=\"mobile_sub_title menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38036 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Food And Drink\" href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Food And Drink</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38037\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38037 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"All Venues\" href=\"/food-drink\" class=\"dropdown-item\">All Venues</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38038\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38038 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Phoenix Bar &#038; Pizzeria\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/food-drink/phoenix-bar-pizzeria/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Phoenix Bar &#038; Pizzeria</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-65751\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-65751 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"The Terrace\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/the-terrace/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">The Terrace</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-65499\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-65499 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"East Court Café\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/food-drink/east-court-cafe/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">East Court Café</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38040\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38040 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Boathouse Café\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/food-drink/boathouse-cafe/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Boathouse Café</a></li>\n\t<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38042\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38042 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Grove Café\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/food-drink/grove-cafe/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Grove Café</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38048\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children