 itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38069\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38069 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Venue Hire\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/venue-hire/spaces/\" class=\"nav-link\">Venue Hire</a></li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38070\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38070 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Contact\" href=\"/contact/get-in-touch\" class=\"nav-link\">Contact</a></li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38071\" class=\"d-block d-lg-none mobile_mailing menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38071 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Join our mailing list\" href=\"/contact/get-in-touch/#footer-newsletter-form\" class=\"nav-link\">Join our mailing list</a></li>\n</ul></div>        </div>\n      </nav>\n      <!-- End Mobile Nav -->\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"search\" id=\"search_container\">\n    <div class=\"search_content\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n          <h1 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search</h1>\n          <h2 class=\"h1\">What are you looking for?</h2>\n        </header>\n\n        <button id=\"btn-search-close\" class=\"btn btn--search-close\" aria-label=\"Close search form\">Close <span></span></button>\n        <label class=\"screen-reader-text\" for=\"search-input\">Search:</label>\n        <form class=\"search__form\" action=\"/search\" method=\"get\" role=\"search\">\n          <input type=\"text\" class=\"search__input\" id=\"search-input\" name=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Start typing...\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" value=\"\" />\n          <button class=\"btn btn--search\"><i class=\"sprite sprite_search_white\"></i><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search</span></button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"search__suggested\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">You might be looking for…</h3>\n          <ul class=\"search_tags\">\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/opening-times/\">OPENING HOURS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\">PARKING</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#sport\">SPORT</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#live-events\">LIVE EVENTS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/about-us/blog/\">BLOG</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"search__related\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">Top results</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 search_suggestions\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-ap btn-pink btn_results pull-right\">All results <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <main class=\"content\" id=\"primary\">\n    <div class=\"header_media proportional_container container--header_media\">\n    <img width=\"2121\" height=\"1414\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1.jpg\" class=\"header_image_desktop\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1.jpg 2121w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-650x433.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-1620x1080.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2121px) 100vw, 2121px\" />    <img width=\"560\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-560x700.jpg\" class=\"header_image_mobile\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></div><div class=\"margins\">\n        <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <ol>\n            <li class=\"crumb\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\">Home</a>\n            </li>\n                        <li class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/\">What&#8217;s On</a></li>            <li class=\"crumb--current\">\n                <span aria-current=\"page\">Rhythm Stick Club Night &#8211; Live From Ally Pally</span>\n            </li>\n        </ol>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"event_content\" class=\"margins grid grid--3_1 component\">\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n        <h1>Rhythm Stick Club Night &#8211; Live From Ally Pally</h1>\n            </div>      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n        <div class=\"event_details\"><p class=\"text-uppercase\">21 Oct 2026</p><p>Starts 19:00</p><p>Alexandra Palace Theatre</p><p>£7</p></div>    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">      \n        <div class=\"ap_text_block\">\n    <p>Join us as our Victorian Theatre is transformed into Rhythm Stick – the most exclusive inclusive club night in London!</p>\n<p>Rhythm Stick is an inclusive club night designed by and for adults with disabilities, and it finally returns home to Alexandra Palace Theatre this October. Grab your glowsticks, slap on some glitter, don your best party fit and throw some shapes.</p>\n<p>Rhythm Stick is part of <em>Live From Ally Pally</em>, a programme of events that marks 90 years since the start of television broadcasting at Alexandra Palace.</p>\n<p><strong>Essential companions go free, please add your free ticket during checkout.</strong></p>\n<p>If you&#8217;d like to get involved with Rhythm Stick, we&#8217;re offering a free course to those who identify as disabled and want to learn about events management. Click the button below for more information,</p>\n</div><a class=\"ap_btn_fill ap_btn_pink \" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/rhythm-stick-events-management-course/\" target=\"\" >Rhythm Stick Events Management Course</a>\n<div class=\"ap_carousel carousel--layout ap_block\">\n    <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                                <div class=\"ap_image_block\">\n                    <img width=\"1620\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-1620x1080.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-1620x1080.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-650x433.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rhythm-Stick-Theatre-1-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1620px) 100vw, 1620px\" />                    \n                </div>\n                            </div>\n                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                                <div class=\"ap_image_block\">\n                    <img width=\"1620\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Rhythm-Stick-pic-1-1620x1080.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-l