s office</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/about-us/careers/\">Careers</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/complaints/\">Complaints</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/site-map/\">Site map</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col-md-3 order-md-4 footer_column\">\n            <ul class=\"list-unstyled text-uppercase footer_menu\">\n              <li><a href=\"/asafeandsecureexperience/\">Safe & secure</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/terms-and-conditions\">T&C<span style=\"text-transform: lowercase;\">s</span></a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy policy</a></li>\n            </ul>\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\" class=\"footer_logo_mobile\"><i class=\"sprite sprite_logo_icon\"></i><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Alexandra Palace Home</span></a>\n\n            <p class=\"copyright\"><span>&copy; 2026 Alexandra Palace.</span><br />All rights reserved. Alexandra Park and Palace Charitable Trust is a registered charity no. <strong>281991</strong></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-md-2 order-md-5 my-auto footer_logo_desktop footer_column\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Alexandra Palace Home</span><i class=\"sprite sprite_logo_icon\"></i></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n<div class=\"modal fade\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" id=\"charity-checkout-donation-modal\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\" style=\"overflow:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; min-height: 500px;\">\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal fade\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" id=\"charity-checkout-donor-board-modal\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\" style=\"overflow:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;  min-height: 500px;\">\n\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal fade\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" id=\"charity-checkout-theatre-tour-modal\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\" style=\"overflow:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;  min-height: 500px;\">\n\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"loading-spinner\">\n  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 266.84 266.77\" id=\"spinner\">\n    <defs>\n      <style>\n        .cls-1 {\n          fill: #003dc6;\n        }\n\n        .cls-2 {\n          fill: #ff8cd6;\n        }\n\n        .cls-3 {\n          fill: #ffd830;\n        }\n\n        .cls-4 {\n          fill: #009e65;\n        }\n\n        .cls-5 {\n          fill: #aae2e0;\n        }\n      </style>\n    </defs>\n    <title>loading</title>\n    <g id=\"Layer_2\" data-name=\"Layer 2\">\n      <g id=\"Layer_1-2\" data-name=\"Layer 1\">\n        <path class=\"cls-1\" d=\"M132.81,32.41h.61V0C74.6,0,25,36.05,6.8,92l30.08,9.77A101,101,0,0,1,132.81,32.41Z\" />\n        <path class=\"cls-2\" d=\"M31.81,133.41a100.69,100.69,0,0,1,5.07-31.65L6.8,92c-18.17,55.94.78,114.27,48.37,148.85l18.54-25.53A100.86,100.86,0,0,1,31.81,133.41Z\" />\n        <path class=\"cls-3\" d=\"M132.81,234.41a100.55,100.55,0,0,1-59.1-19.