class=\"search__suggested\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">You might be looking for…</h3>\n          <ul class=\"search_tags\">\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/opening-times/\">OPENING HOURS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\">PARKING</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#sport\">SPORT</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#live-events\">LIVE EVENTS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/about-us/blog/\">BLOG</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"search__related\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">Top results</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 search_suggestions\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-ap btn-pink btn_results pull-right\">All results <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <main class=\"content\" id=\"primary\">\n    <div class=\"header_media proportional_container container--header_media\">\n    <img width=\"1920\" height=\"467\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Gary-Delaney-TOUR-IMAGE-1920-x-720-e1783426401444.jpg\" class=\"header_image_desktop\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Gary-Delaney-TOUR-IMAGE-1920-x-720-e1783426401444.jpg 1920w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Gary-Delaney-TOUR-IMAGE-1920-x-720-e1783426401444-650x158.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Gary-Delaney-TOUR-IMAGE-1920-x-720-e1783426401444-1620x394.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Gary-Delaney-TOUR-IMAGE-1920-x-720-e1783426401444-768x187.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Gary-Delaney-TOUR-IMAGE-1920-x-720-e1783426401444-1536x374.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />    <img width=\"560\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Gary-Delaney-TOUR-IMAGE-1080-x-1080-560x700.jpg\" class=\"header_image_mobile\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></div><div class=\"margins\">\n        <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <ol>\n            <li class=\"crumb\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\">Home</a>\n            </li>\n                        <li class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/\">What&#8217;s On</a></li>            <li class=\"crumb--current\">\n                <span aria-current=\"page\">Gary Delaney &#8211; Gary On Laughing</span>\n            </li>\n        </ol>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"event_content\" class=\"margins grid grid--3_1 component\">\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n        <h1>Gary Delaney &#8211; Gary On Laughing</h1>\n            </div>      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n        <div class=\"event_details\"><p class=\"text-uppercase\">29 Oct 2026</p><p>Doors open 19:00</p><p>Alexandra Palace Theatre</p></div>    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">      \n        <div class=\"ap_text_block\">\n    <p>Gary Delaney’s last UK tour ran for two and a half years across 378 dates. People laughed a lot and kept coming back. His videos have hundreds of millions of views. So now he’s doing it all again, bringing his brand-new show to Alexandra Palace Theatre.</p>\n<p>All new jokes and utterly splendid filth. Come along. It’ll be fun. Don’t bring the kids or people who like to get their knickers in a twist. Do wear a TENA pad or dark trousers.</p>\n<p><strong>Age recommendation: 16+</strong></p>\n</div><div class=\"section full_width bg_light_pink mobile_only\">\n            <div class=\"ap_carousel carousel--review\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>&#8220;More quality jokes in one hour than most comics have in their entire careers&#8230;Quite brilliant&#8221;</p>\n                                <cite>The Scotsman</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>&#8220;A master craftsman&#8221;</p>\n                                <cite>The Times</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"button--prev\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Previous Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                <div class=\"button--next\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Next Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-7\"><table class=\"table event_timetable ap_table blue\" id=\"doors-opening-times\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Date</th><th scope=\"col\">Doors<br/>open</th><th scope=\"col\">Start<br/>time</th><th scope=\"col\">End<br/>time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\" class=\"text-uppercase\">29 Oct 2026</th><td>19:00</td><td>20:00</td><td>22:00</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    </div>                      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n                   <ul class=\"event_buttons\">\n            <li class=\"tickets_btn\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn-pink btn_arrow btn-block spektrix-ticket\" href=\"#tickets\">Buy Tickets</a>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n        <ul class=\"event_buttons\">\n                                            <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\" >How to get here</a>\n                </li>\n                                                                    <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/faqs#theatre\" >FAQs</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/asafeandsecureexperience/\" >Safe and secure</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/visitor-information/accessibility/\" >Accessibility</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"https://booking.stay22.com/alexandrapalace/HNGxs49gSC\" target=\"_blank\">Accommodation</a>\n                </li>\n                        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n    <div id=\"buy_tickets_component\" class=\"margins  component d-none\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid--3_1 buy_tickets--inner\">\n            <div id=\"basket-header\" class=\"grid--item grid--item--span grid grid--3_1\">\n                <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n                    <div id=\"back-to-event-btn\">\n                        <button class=\"button ap_btn_fill bg-white blue\">back to event</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n                    <h1>Gary Delaney &#8211; Gary On Laughing</h1>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--2\" id=\"basket-wrapper\">     \n                <div class=\"spektrix-basket-component\">\n                    <div class=\"spektrix-basket-component\">\n                        <spektrix-basket-summary client-name=\"alexandrapalace\" custom-domain=\"tickets.alexandrapalace.com\" >\n                            <h3>BASKET SUMMARY</h3>\n                                <span data-basket-item-count></span> item(s)\n                                <br />\n                                Discount:\n                                <span data-basket-summary-currency></span>\n                                <span data-basket-summary-discount-total></span>\n                                <div class=\"basket-summary-total\">\n                                    Total:\n                                    <span data-basket-summary-currency></span>\n                                    <span data-basket-summary-basket-total></span>\n                                </div>\n                        </spektrix-basket-summary>\n                    </div>                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--span\">    \n                <iframe\n            name=\"SpektrixIFrame\"\n            id=\"SpektrixIFrame\"\n            frameborder=\"0\"\n            src=\"\"\n            data-src=\"https://tickets.alexandrapalace.com/alexandrapalace/website/ChooseSeats.aspx?EventInstanceId=958601&Optimise=mobile&stylesheet=spektrix-iframe-styles.css&resize=true\"\n            \n            style=\"width: 100%; height: 1000px;\"onload=\"window.onSpektrixIframeLoad && window.onSpektrixIframeLoad(event)\"\n        >\n        </iframe>            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div id=\"event_secondary_content\">    \n    <div class=\"full_width banner bg_image banner_single\">\n\n    <div class=\"container--banner overlay_bg\">\n\n        <img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-650x433.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-1620x1080.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />\n        <div class=\"banner__content padding\">\n\n           \n                        <h3 style=\"text-align: center\" class=\"white\" aria-level=\"2\">\n                            Skip the queues                        </h3> \n\n            \n            <h2 style=\"text-align: center\" class=\"white\" aria-level=\"3\">Raise a glass!</h2>\n            <p class=\"white\"> Pre-order your interval drinks online when booking your tickets, or at the bar before the show begins. \r\nFancy something more? Drop by the East Court Café for sweet treats, snacks, and daily hot specials.</p>\n\n                            <a class=\"ap_btn_fill bg-light-pink blue\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/theatre/food-drink/\"  title=\"Raise a glass!\">Discover food & drink</a>\n                        \n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n   \n</div><div class=\"section full_width bg_light_pink desktop_only padding\">\n            <div class=\"ap_carousel carousel--review\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>&#8220;More quality jokes in one hour than most comics have in their entire careers&#8230;Quite brilliant&#8221;</p>\n                                <cite>The Scotsman</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>&#8220;A master craftsman&#8221;</p>\n                                <cite>The Times</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"button--prev\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Previous Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                <div class=\"button--next\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Next Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"section full_width bg_aqua padding ap_block_related\">\n            <h2 class=\"color-blue\">You may also be interested in...</h2>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex_33\"  id=\"events-container\">\n                                            <div class=\"flex_item\">\n                            <div class=\"event_card_wrapper event_item event_card grid  \"  >\n        <div class=\"event_img proportional_container container--fivefour\">\n             <img width=\"650\" height=\"566\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DylanMoran_MattCrockett_152_300mm_300dpi-copy-650x566.jpg\" class=