https://www.alexandrapalace.com/support-us/\" class=\"nav-link\">Support Us</a></li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38069\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-38069 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Venue Hire\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/venue-hire/spaces/\" class=\"nav-link\">Venue Hire</a></li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38070\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38070 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Contact\" href=\"/contact/get-in-touch\" class=\"nav-link\">Contact</a></li>\n<li itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" id=\"menu-item-38071\" class=\"d-block d-lg-none mobile_mailing menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38071 nav-item\" role=\"menuitem\"><a title=\"Join our mailing list\" href=\"/contact/get-in-touch/#footer-newsletter-form\" class=\"nav-link\">Join our mailing list</a></li>\n</ul></div>        </div>\n      </nav>\n      <!-- End Mobile Nav -->\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"search\" id=\"search_container\">\n    <div class=\"search_content\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n          <h1 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search</h1>\n          <h2 class=\"h1\">What are you looking for?</h2>\n        </header>\n\n        <button id=\"btn-search-close\" class=\"btn btn--search-close\" aria-label=\"Close search form\">Close <span></span></button>\n        <label class=\"screen-reader-text\" for=\"search-input\">Search:</label>\n        <form class=\"search__form\" action=\"/search\" method=\"get\" role=\"search\">\n          <input type=\"text\" class=\"search__input\" id=\"search-input\" name=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Start typing...\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" value=\"\" />\n          <button class=\"btn btn--search\"><i class=\"sprite sprite_search_white\"></i><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search</span></button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"search__suggested\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">You might be looking for…</h3>\n          <ul class=\"search_tags\">\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/opening-times/\">OPENING HOURS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\">PARKING</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#sport\">SPORT</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#live-events\">LIVE EVENTS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/about-us/blog/\">BLOG</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"search__related\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">Top results</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 search_suggestions\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-ap btn-pink btn_results pull-right\">All results <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <main class=\"content\" id=\"primary\">\n    <div class=\"header_media proportional_container container--header_media\">\n    <img width=\"2560\" height=\"840\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sherlock-2026-e1782314852403.jpg\" class=\"header_image_desktop\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sherlock-2026-e1782314852403.jpg 2560w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sherlock-2026-e1782314852403-650x213.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sherlock-2026-e1782314852403-1620x532.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sherlock-2026-e1782314852403-768x252.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sherlock-2026-e1782314852403-1536x504.jpg 1536w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sherlock-2026-e1782314852403-2048x672.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />    <img width=\"560\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/8741_03_SH_Social_1080x1080px-560x700.jpg\" class=\"header_image_mobile\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></div><div class=\"margins\">\n        <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <ol>\n            <li class=\"crumb\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\">Home</a>\n            </li>\n                        <li class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/\">What&#8217;s On</a></li>            <li class=\"crumb--current\">\n                <span aria-current=\"page\">Sherlock Holmes and the 12 Days of Christmas</span>\n            </li>\n        </ol>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"event_content\" class=\"margins grid grid--3_1 component\">\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n        <h1>Sherlock Holmes and the 12 Days of Christmas</h1>\n            </div>      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n        <div class=\"event_details\"><p class=\"text-uppercase\">24 Nov 2026 - 17 Jan 2027</p><p id=\"door-open-table-link\">Door Opening Times</p><p>Alexandra Palace Theatre</p></div>    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">      \n        <div class=\"ap_text_block\">\n    <p>It’s Christmas in Victorian London. In the West End, performers are suddenly dropping dead mid-scene. When the world&#8217;s greatest detective, Sherlock Holmes, uncovers a chilling connection to The Twelve Days of Christmas, he knows something sinister is afoot.</p>\n<p>With the body count rising and time running out, Sherlock must catch the killer before the next murder. But as he hurtles towards a deadly showdown, will this be the case that finally brings down the great detective?</p>\n<p>Perfectly set at <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/theatre/story/\">Alexandra Palace Theatre</a>, one of London’s most atmospheric Victorian theatres, audiences can immerse themselves in a festive murder mystery packed with mayhem, mischief and Christmas cheer!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><div class=\"ap_accordion_block ap_block\" id=\"more-information\">\n    <h3>MORE INFORMATION</h3>\n            <details class=\"ap_accordion\" id=\"age-recommendation\">\n                <summary>AGE RECOMMENDATION</summary>\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <p>10+ years. <span data-teams=\"true\">This performance contains moderate language, innuendo and gunshot sound effects.</span></p>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n                        <details class=\"ap_accordion\" id=\"running-time\">\n                <summary>Running Time</summary>\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <p>2 hours 30 minutes, including interval</p>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n                        <details class=\"ap_accordion\" id=\"accessible-performances\">\n                <summary>Accessible performances</summary>\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <p>Audio described performance &#8211; 12 Jan 2027, 19:30</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Captioned performance &#8211; 3 Jan 2027, 13:00</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            </div><div class=\"section full_width bg_light_pink mobile_only\">\n            <div class=\"ap_carousel carousel--review\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>&#8220;Gleefully theatrical&#8221;</p>\n                                <cite>The Guardian</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>&#8220;A madcap romp… brilliantly blends elements of the traditional Holmes detective tale with the craziness of pantomime and general festive cheer&#8221;</p>\n                                <cite>WhatsOnStage</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"button--prev\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Previous Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                <div class=\"button--next\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Next Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124