 Christmas</h1>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--2\" id=\"basket-wrapper\">     \n                <div class=\"spektrix-basket-component\">\n                    <div class=\"spektrix-basket-component\">\n                        <spektrix-basket-summary client-name=\"alexandrapalace\" custom-domain=\"tickets.alexandrapalace.com\" >\n                            <h3>BASKET SUMMARY</h3>\n                                <span data-basket-item-count></span> item(s)\n                                <br />\n                                Discount:\n                                <span data-basket-summary-currency></span>\n                                <span data-basket-summary-discount-total></span>\n                                <div class=\"basket-summary-total\">\n                                    Total:\n                                    <span data-basket-summary-currency></span>\n                                    <span data-basket-summary-basket-total></span>\n                                </div>\n                        </spektrix-basket-summary>\n                    </div>                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--span\">    \n                <div id=\"buy_tickets_api_component\" class=\"api_component\"><div id=\"select_tickets\" class=\"ChooseSeats \"><h1 id=\"tickets\">Select your dates</h1><div id=\"color-calendar\"></div><div id=\"response\"></div></div><div class=\"iframe-wrapper d-none\"><iframe\n            name=\"SpektrixIFrame\"\n            id=\"SpektrixIFrame\"\n            frameborder=\"0\"\n            src=\"\"\n            data-src=\"https://tickets.alexandrapalace.com/alexandrapalace/website/ChooseSeats.aspx?EventInstanceId=__id__&Optimise=mobile&stylesheet=spektrix-iframe-styles.css&resize=true\"\n            \n            style=\"width: 100%; height: 1000px;\"onload=\"window.onSpektrixIframeLoad && window.onSpektrixIframeLoad(event)\"\n        >\n        </iframe></div></div>            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div id=\"event_secondary_content\">    \n    <div class=\"section full_width bg_light_pink desktop_only padding\">\n            <div class=\"ap_carousel carousel--review\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>&#8220;Gleefully theatrical&#8221;</p>\n                                <cite>The Guardian</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>&#8220;A madcap romp… brilliantly blends elements of the traditional Holmes detective tale with the craziness of pantomime and general festive cheer&#8221;</p>\n                                <cite>WhatsOnStage</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"button--prev\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Previous Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                <div class=\"button--next\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Next Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"full_width banner bg_image banner_single\">\n\n    <div class=\"container--banner overlay_bg\">\n\n        <img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-650x433.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-1620x1080.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/R6LW4175-AllyPally-VIPROOM-120225-LloydWinters-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />\n        <div class=\"banner__content padding\">\n\n           \n                        <h3 style=\"text-align: center\" class=\"white\" aria-level=\"2\">\n                            Skip the queues                        </h3> \n\n            \n            <h2 style=\"text-align: center\" class=\"white\" aria-level=\"3\">Raise a glass!</h2>\n            <p class=\"white\"> Pre-order your interval drinks online when booking your tickets, or at the bar before the show begins. \r\nFancy something more? Drop by the East Court Café for sweet treats, snacks, and daily hot specials.</p>\n\n                            <a class=\"ap_btn_fill bg-light-pink blue\" href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/theatre/food-drink/\"  title=\"Raise a glass!\">Discover food & drink</a>\n                        \n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n   \n</div></div>  <div class=\"container-fluid section-footer-newsletter-form\" id=\"footer-newsletter-form\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n              <h2 style=\"text-align: left\" class=\"vc_custom_heading\">Sign up to our newsletter</h2>\n              <p>\n                Join our mailing list for Ally Pally updates, news and exclusive access to pre-sale tickets\n              </p>\n                      <form data-action=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-json/spektrix/v1/form_tags\" class=\"form-inline\" id=\"ap_form_tags\" data-redirect=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/thank-you-for-signing-up/\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Tags\" name=\"Tags\" value=\"17601ADSBKGQMMPTLRCMTNQVQJNSBPVNG\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"form_tags_nonce\" name=\"form_tags_nonce\" value=\"6300675430\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wp_http_referer\" value=\"/whats-on/sherlock-holmes-12-days-of-xmas/\" />            <div class=\"form-group name-group\">\n                <label for=\"FirstName\">Name</label>\n                <input name=\"FirstName\" id=\"FirstName\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter your first name\" required/>\n           