><i class=\"sprite sprite_search_white\"></i><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search</span></button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"search__suggested\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">You might be looking for…</h3>\n          <ul class=\"search_tags\">\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/opening-times/\">OPENING HOURS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\">PARKING</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#sport\">SPORT</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#live-events\">LIVE EVENTS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/about-us/blog/\">BLOG</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"search__related\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">Top results</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 search_suggestions\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-ap btn-pink btn_results pull-right\">All results <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <main class=\"content\" id=\"primary\">\n    <div class=\"header_media proportional_container container--header_media\">\n    <img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Tina-1920x1080-whats-love-clean.jpg\" class=\"header_image_desktop\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Tina-1920x1080-whats-love-clean.jpg 1920w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Tina-1920x1080-whats-love-clean-650x366.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Tina-1920x1080-whats-love-clean-1620x911.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Tina-1920x1080-whats-love-clean-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Tina-1920x1080-whats-love-clean-1536x864.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />    <img width=\"560\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Tina-1080x1080-whats-love-clean-560x700.jpg\" class=\"header_image_mobile\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></div><div class=\"margins\">\n        <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <ol>\n            <li class=\"crumb\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\">Home</a>\n            </li>\n                        <li class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/\">What&#8217;s On</a></li>            <li class=\"crumb--current\">\n                <span aria-current=\"page\">What&#8217;s Love Got To Do With It</span>\n            </li>\n        </ol>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"event_content\" class=\"margins grid grid--3_1 component\">\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n        <h1>What&#8217;s Love Got To Do With It</h1>\n            </div>      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n        <div class=\"event_details\"><p class=\"text-uppercase\">28 Feb 2027</p><p>Doors open 18:30</p><p>Alexandra Palace Theatre</p></div>    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">      \n        <div class=\"ap_text_block\">\n    <p>After a fantastic sell-out debut tour across the UK, Tina Turner fans will have the time of their lives as <em><strong>What’s Love Got To Do With It?</strong></em> returns to Alexandra Palace Theatre in 2027, celebrating the music and career of this incredible rock and soul legend.</p>\n<p>Expect a night of high energy and feel-good rock- and-roll, performed by an all-live band. This joyous show features all the hits including Proud Mary, River Deep, Simply The Best, Private Dancer, and many more!</p>\n<p>Please note that this is a tribute production and is not endorsed by or affiliated with the Tina Turner Estate.</p>\n<p><strong>Age recommendation:</strong> 16+</p>\n</div><div class=\"ap_carousel carousel--layout ap_block\">\n    <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                                <div class=\"ap_image_block\">\n                    <img width=\"1620\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/QueenOfTheNight_10thAnniversaryGalaNight_O2London_CharlieFlintPhotography_2025-528-1620x1080.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/QueenOfTheNight_10thAnniversaryGalaNight_O2London_CharlieFlintPhotography_2025-528-1620x1080.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/QueenOfTheNight_10thAnniversaryGalaNight_O2London_CharlieFlintPhotography_2025-528-650x433.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/QueenOfTheNight_10thAnniversaryGalaNight_O2London_CharlieFlintPhotography_2025-528-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/QueenOfTheNight_10thAnniversaryGalaNight_O2London_CharlieFlintPhotography_2025-528-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/QueenOfTheNight_10thAnniversaryGalaNight_O2London_CharlieFlintPhotography_2025-528-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1620px) 100vw, 1620px\" />                    \n                </div>\n                            </div>\n                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                                <div class=\"ap_image_block\">\n                    <img width=\"1620\" height=\"1078\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/QueenOfTheNight_10thAnniversaryGalaNight_O2London_CharlieFlintPhotography_2025-518-1620x1078.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\"