s=\"search__suggested\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">You might be looking for…</h3>\n          <ul class=\"search_tags\">\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/opening-times/\">OPENING HOURS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\">PARKING</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#sport\">SPORT</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/whats-on/#live-events\">LIVE EVENTS</a></li>\n            <li class=\"search_tag\"><a href=\"/about-us/blog/\">BLOG</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"search__related\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">Top results</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 search_suggestions\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-ap btn-pink btn_results pull-right\">All results <i class=\"sprite sprite_btn_arrow_blue\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <main class=\"content\" id=\"primary\">\n    <div class=\"header_media proportional_container container--header_media\">\n    <img width=\"1907\" height=\"1003\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DylanMoran_MattCrockett_152_300mm_300dpi-scaled-e1772789772435.jpg\" class=\"header_image_desktop\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DylanMoran_MattCrockett_152_300mm_300dpi-scaled-e1772789772435.jpg 1907w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DylanMoran_MattCrockett_152_300mm_300dpi-scaled-e1772789772435-650x342.jpg 650w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DylanMoran_MattCrockett_152_300mm_300dpi-scaled-e1772789772435-1620x852.jpg 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DylanMoran_MattCrockett_152_300mm_300dpi-scaled-e1772789772435-768x404.jpg 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DylanMoran_MattCrockett_152_300mm_300dpi-scaled-e1772789772435-1536x808.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1907px) 100vw, 1907px\" />    <img width=\"560\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DylanMoran_MattCrockett_152_300mm_300dpi-copy-560x700.jpg\" class=\"header_image_mobile\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></div><div class=\"margins\">\n        <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <ol>\n            <li class=\"crumb\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\">Home</a>\n            </li>\n                        <li class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/\">What&#8217;s On</a></li>            <li class=\"crumb--current\">\n                <span aria-current=\"page\">Dylan Moran &#8211; Looking For Trouble</span>\n            </li>\n        </ol>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"event_content\" class=\"margins grid grid--3_1 component\">\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n        <h1>Dylan Moran &#8211; Looking For Trouble</h1>\n            </div>      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n        <div class=\"event_details\"><p class=\"text-uppercase\">28 - 29 May 2027</p><p>Doors open 19:00</p><p>Alexandra Palace Theatre</p></div>    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">      \n        <div class=\"ap_text_block\">\n    <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Showtime. What are you going to do? </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are you going to go to work? Or stay in bed, chasing oblivion. Guess what?</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We&#8217;re fresh out of oblivion.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Economy will do fine without you &#8211; but how long will you survive without the usual giant horn of frozen caramel latte and the five thousand other pieces of bullshit you have smushed together so you can point at it and croak ‘That’s my ..life?’</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Now, now, all this drama and we’re not even out the door yet.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Find out how it could all have been different. Find out how to reclaim your life by becoming a lethal kickboxing, chess champion. Pioneer new trends in global lovemaking, join tan elite band trillionaire poet/pastry chef/mountineers. Just go</span></p>\n<p><strong>BAFTA</strong> and <strong>Perrier Award</strong>-winning comedian and star of <em>Black Books</em>, <strong>Dylan Moran</strong>, brings his brand new show to Alexandra Palace Theatre in May 2027 for two nights only.</p>\n<p><strong>Age recommendation: 16+</strong></p>\n</div><div class=\"section full_width bg_light_pink mobile_only\">\n            <div class=\"ap_carousel carousel--review\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>“Joyfully cynical ”</p>\n                                <cite>Metro</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>“Perfect for the times”</p>\n                                <cite>The i</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>“Superb”</p>\n                                <cite>The Guardian</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                            <div class=\"ap_stars flex\">\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.12 31.92\"><path fill=\"#013dc6\" d=\"M33.12 12.096H20.684l-4.128-12.1-4.128 12.1H0l10.084 7.776L6.432 31.92l10.128-7.2 10.124 7.2-3.644-12.048Z\"/></svg>                                </div>\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p>“Trumping Shakespeare, he reduces life to four ages: “Child, failure, old and dead”. Faced with one-liners as killing as that the world suddenly seems a better place”</p>\n                                <cite>Telegraph</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"button--prev\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Previous Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                <div class=\"button--next\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Next Slide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 254.8 169.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 254.8 169.5\"><path d=\"M254.8 83.7s0-29.9-34.8-30.7c-27.5.2-59.6 28.8-114.2 28.5l-85.4.2C90.8 70.6 123.5 56.8 124 28.1c-.6-15.6-7.1-24.7-41.2-28.1C69.2 71 0 83.7 0 83.7v2.1s69.2 12.7 82.8 83.7c34.2-3.4 40.6-12.5 41.2-28.1-.6-28.7-33.3-42.5-103.6-53.6l85.4.2c54.6-.3 86.7 28.3 114.2 28.5 34.8-.8 34.8-30.7 34.8-30.7v-2.1z\"/></svg></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-7\"><table class=\"table event_timetable ap_table blue\" id=\"doors-opening-times\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Date</th><th scope=\"col\">Doors<br/>open</th><th scope=\"col\">Start<br/>time</th><th scope=\"col\">End<br/>time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\" class=\"text-uppercase\">28 May 2027</th><td>19:00</td><td>20:00</td><td>21:30</td></tr><tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\" class=\"text-uppercase\">29 May 2027</th><td>19:00</td><td>20:00</td><td>21:30</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    </div>                      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n                   <ul class=\"event_buttons\">\n            <li class=\"tickets_btn\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn-pink btn_arrow btn-block spektrix-ticket\" href=\"#tickets\">Buy Tickets</a>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n        <ul class=\"event_buttons\">\n                                            <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/visitor-information/get-here/\" >How to get here</a>\n                </li>\n                                                                    <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/faqs\" >FAQs</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/asafeandsecureexperience/\" >Safe and secure</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"/visitor-information/accessibility/\" >Accessibility</a>\n                </li>\n                                                <li>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-blue\" href=\"https://booking.stay22.com/alexandrapalace/HNGxs49gSC\" target=\"_blank\">Accommodation</a>\n                </li>\n                        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n    <div id=\"buy_tickets_component\" class=\"margins  component d-none\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid--3_1 buy_tickets--inner\">\n            <div id=\"basket-header\" class=\"grid--item grid--item--span grid grid--3_1\">\n                <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n                    <div id=\"back-to-event-btn\">\n                        <button class=\"button ap_btn_fill bg-white blue\">back to event</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n                    <h1>Dylan Moran &#8211; Looking For Trouble</h1>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--2\" id=\"basket-wrapper\">     \n                <div class=\"spektrix-basket-component\">\n                    <div class=\"spektrix-basket-component\">\n                        <spektrix-basket-summary client-name=\"alexandrapalace\" custom-domain=\"tickets.alexandrapalace.com\" >\n                            <h3>BASKET SUMMARY</h3>\n                                <span data-basket-item-count></span> item(s)\n                                <br />\n                                Discount:\n                                <span data-basket-summary-currency></span>\n                                <span data-basket-summary-discount-total></span>\n                                <div class=\"basket-summary-total\">\n                                    Total:\n                                    <span data-basket-summary-currency></span>\n                                    <span data-basket-summary-basket-total></span>\n                                </div>\n                        </spektrix-basket-summary>\n                    </div>                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--span\">    \n                <div id=\"buy_tickets_api_component\" class=\"api_component\"><div id=\"select_tickets\" class=\"ChooseSeats \"><h1 id=\"tickets\">Select your dates</h1><div id=\"color-calendar\"></div><div id=\"response\"></div></div><div class=\"iframe-wrapper d-none\"><iframe\n            name=\"SpektrixIFrame\"\n            id=\"SpektrixIFrame\"\n            frameborder=\"0\"\n            src=\"\"\n            data-src=\"https://tickets.alexandrapalace.com/alexandrapalace/website/ChooseSeats.aspx?EventInstanceId=__id__&Optimise=mobile&stylesheet=spektrix-iframe-styles.css&resize=true\"\n            \n            style=\"width: 100%; height: 1000px;\"onload=\"window.onSpektrixIframeLoad && window.onSpektrixIframeLoad(event)\"\n        >\n        </iframe></div></div>            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div id=\"event_secondary_content\">    \n    <div class=\"section full_width bg_light_pink desktop_only padding\">\n            <div class=\"ap_carousel carou